            "is_video": false,
            "caption": "Happy Sunday from Coffee & More \u2600\ufe0f\ud83c\udf37\n\nLooks like we\u2019re finally getting a beautiful stretch of 70\u00b0+ weather all week long and we are HERE for it! \ud83d\ude4c Come swing by the little green bus, say hi, and grab one of our spring specials before they disappear for the season. \ud83c\udf38\n\nAll of our spring drinks can be made iced or hot \u2014 whether you\u2019re soaking up the sunshine with an iced latte or starting your morning with something cozy. \u2615\ud83e\uddcb\n\nAnd\u2026 only a couple more weeks until our NEW summer menu drops \ud83d\udc40\ud83c\udf34 We\u2019ve been working on some fun seasonal flavors and can\u2019t wait to share them with you all!\n\nAlso good news \u2014 online ordering will be back ON at many of our locations this week, making it easier to skip the line and grab your favorites! \ud83d\udcf2\u2728\n\nOne more thing\u2026 we\u2019ve already had people asking about our gallon cold brew options again this year \ud83d\udc4f We\u2019re thinking both single flavors AND specialty flavors. Anyone else interested?! \ud83d\udc40\n\nLiving in the More \ud83d\udc9a\n\n#CoffeeAndMoreSF #LivingInTheMore #SiouxFallsCoffee #CoffeeTruck #MobileCoffee",
